cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: Reusable Async ML API Platform
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-06-15"
license: EUPL-1.2
repository-code: https://github.com/RitAreaSciencePark/sem-image-classifier-api
abstract: >
  A codegen-driven async ML API platform on Kubernetes, built on BentoML,
  Redis, KrakenD, and PostgreSQL. Operators define services in YAML; the
  generator renders identical dev and prod deployment bundles. Decouples
  generic async queue orchestration, modality-specific input handling, and
  model inference into independent layers. Ships with Hugging Face ViT SEM
  image classifiers as reference implementations for the NFFA-DI Digital
  Ecosystem at AREA Science Park.
